   "widgets": [
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">GET STARTED</p>\n    <h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Request pricing for your private label supplement line.</h1>\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">Tell us what you're planning and we will send back transparent pricing within one business day. No sales pressure, no follow-up calls until you say so.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Submit Quote Request</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201609325,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">What we need to give you accurate pricing.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">The more we know about your plans, the more accurate our pricing will be. The minimum we need: which products you're interested in, approximate order volumes, packaging preferences, and any branding or design considerations.</p><p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">[PLACEHOLDER FOR JUSTIN: HubSpot form embed goes here once form is created. Form fields should include: name, email, phone, business name, products of interest (multi-select), estimated order volume, target launch date, additional notes.]</p>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201609326,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: white; padding: 10px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Your business name and contact information</p>\n    </div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Which products you're considering (browse our category pages)</p>\n    </div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Approximate order volume per SKU</p>\n    </div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Target launch date</p>\n    </div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Any specific packaging or design requirements</p>\n    </div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n      <div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #6BA644; color: white; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\">&#10003;</div>\n      <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Any questions or context you want us to know upfront</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201609327,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background-color: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 24px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    \n        <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px;\">\n          <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-weight: 700;\">Request transparent pricing</h2>\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; opacity: 0.85; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">Tell us what you are planning and we will respond with accurate pricing within one business day.</p></div>\n    <div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; padding: 40px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\">\n      <div id=\"hsform_824d9d5ca5e4\"></div>\n      <script charset=\"utf-8\" type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\"></script>\n      <script>\n        if (window.hbspt) {\n          hbspt.forms.create({\n            portalId: \"4087538\",\n            formId: \"824d9d5c-a5e4-4e36-9704-fd733cf4db30\",\n            target: \"#hsform_824d9d5ca5e4\"\n          });\n        }\n      </script>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201609328,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ready to launch your private label supplement line?</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Schedule a consultation. We will walk through your audience, the right formulations for them, branding options, and the timeline.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201609329,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {},
     "id": 218949791249,
     "label": "PL - Global Guide Offer",
     "module_id": 218944099153,
     "order": 5,
     "type": "module"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201609331,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">None</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What happens after I submit a quote request?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">We reply within one business day with either a direct quote (if your request is specific enough to price accurately) or a scoping conversation request (if we need more detail). Most requests need a brief follow-up to get pricing right.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Will I be asked to sign anything to get pricing?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">No. Quotes are free and non-binding. We give you transparent pricing so you can evaluate fit. There's no commitment until you sign a Private Label Agreement, which happens later in the process.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Can I get pricing without disclosing my full business plan?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. For initial pricing we need to know: which formulations interest you, what quantities, what packaging. We don't need to know your customer acquisition strategy or financial plan to price a manufacturing engagement.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>How long is a quote valid for?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Most quotes are valid for 90 days. Ingredient costs can fluctuate (especially for botanicals subject to seasonal pricing), so longer-validity quotes may carry adjustment language. We're transparent about which line items can move and which are locked.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Do quotes include shipping and fulfillment?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Manufacturing quotes include production, quality testing, certificates of analysis, label printing, and bottling. Shipping to your fulfillment location is quoted separately because it depends on quantity, destination, and shipping method. We can also provide warehousing and fulfillment options as a separate line.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201609332,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
